## Color Palette

### Primary Colors
| Name | Hex | Usage |
|------|-----|-------|
| Background | `#FDFCFD` | Screen backgrounds |
| Primary | `#227CC5` | Buttons, links, accents |
| Text | `#2E2E2E` | Primary text, headings |
| Secondary | `#5F6368` | Captions, placeholders |

### Semantic Colors
| Name | Hex | Usage |
|------|-----|-------|
| Success | `#43A661` | Success states |
| Danger | `#153871` | Errors, destructive actions |
| Warning | `#F2C94C` | Warnings |

