## Typography

| Name | Size | Weight | Usage |
|------|------|--------|-------|
| title | 28px | Bold | Screen titles |
| heading | 24px | Bold | Section headers |
| body | 16px | Regular | Body text, inputs |
| caption | 14px | Regular | Timestamps, hints |
| small | 12px | Regular | Labels, badges |

---

## Spacing

Use multiples of 8:

| Name | Value | Usage |
|------|-------|-------|
| xs | 4px | Icon gaps |
| sm | 8px | Related elements |
| md | 16px | Default gap |
| lg | 24px | Screen padding |
| xl | 32px | Sections |

### Common Values
- Screen padding: 24px
- Card padding: 16px
- Input/Button height: 48px
- Gap between elements: 16px
- Gap between cards: 12px

---

## Border Radius

| Name | Value | Usage |
|------|-------|-------|
| sm | 4px | Tags, badges |
| md | 8px | Buttons, inputs, cards |
| lg | 16px | Modals |
| full | 9999px | Pills, avatars |

