## State Screens

### Loading
- Center an ActivityIndicator
- Color: primary (#227CC5)

### Empty
- Center content
- Large emoji/icon (48-64px)
- Message in secondary color
- Optional action button

### Error
- Center content
- Error icon in danger color
- Error message
- "Try Again" button
